  <!--EN: A musty, warm, almost woody tea crafted by simple leaves and complex spices. Masala chai acts as a home remedy against wound infections, reducing the severity of a random infection by 5%.-->
  <VBE_MasalaChai.description>一种带有霉味、温暖、近乎木香的茶，由简单的叶子和复杂的香料制成。 Masala chai 是一种针对伤口感染的家庭疗法，可将随机感染的严重程度降低 5%。</VBE_MasalaChai.description>
